{
  "explanation": "An attacker compromised the Jenkins service account and escalated privileges to root to tamper with system forensics. They attempted to hide their tracks by emptying the authentication log file (/var/log/auth.log) and clearing the shell history. This behavior is a classic indicator of defense evasion aimed at destroying evidence of unauthorized access.",
  "mitre_tactic": "Defense Evasion",
  "recommended_actions": [
    "Isolate the affected host (app-02) immediately to prevent further malicious activity or lateral movement.",
    "Revoke and rotate credentials for the Jenkins service account and investigate how initial access was achieved.",
    "Implement centralized log management (SIEM) to ensure critical logs are forwarded off the host in real-time and cannot be deleted locally."
  ]
}
